  "description": "Connects the OASIS to EOSIO -- the delegated proof-of-stake blockchain with feeless transactions (resource model), 4,000+ TPS, and WASM smart contracts. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens on EOS mainnet or sidechains. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
